## About this report

This brief was researched live from public sources at the time shown. Every page was fetched only where the site permits automated access. Each finding quotes its source exactly, and numbers are read by code, not by a model. For web pages, an independent checker model confirmed that the quoted passage supports the finding; official statistics were matched by code to the record the provider published. Findings that failed any check are not shown. Questions without an acceptable answer are reported with what was searched.

